}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/sms">SMS</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Admissions</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Admissions & Student Enrollment</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-standard intake engine that manages the transition from prospective applicant 
            to fully enrolled student with structural precision and data integrity.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Digital Intake & Staging</h2>
        <p>
            Standardize the admissions process with a parent-facing application portal. Frame 
            allows parents to submit application data online, including the staging of 
            required historical documents—birth certificates, national ID copies, and 
            previous school reports—directly into the student dossier. Admissions 
            staff can review applications, manage waiting lists with priority ranking, 
            and coordinate placement tests through a unified administrative interface.
        </p>
        <p>
            Historical cohort tracking (e.g., 'Form 1 2026') ensures that the school has a 
            complete, searchable record of every application cycle, essential for 
            enrollment pattern analysis and facility planning.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Structural Alignment & Sibling Linkage</h2>
        <p>
            Build a definitive student record from hour one. The system automatically 
            generates unique Student ID numbers and parent login credentials upon 
            successful enrollment, ensuring a seamless transition into the academic 
            and financial ecosystems. Sibling linkage capabilities automatically 
            connect multi-child families, facilitating the application of family-based 
            fee discounts and simplifying parent communication cycles.
        </p>
        <p>
            Class capacity controls prevent over-enrollment beyond authorized teacher-student 
            ratios, maintaining the instructional quality standards of the 
            institution.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Seamless Transition to Academics</h2>
        <p>
            Once enrolled, students are assigned to their academic forms, houses, and sports 
            teams. All registration data—including allergies, emergency contacts, and 
            previous academic results—is instantly available to authorized teaching 
            and medical staff, ensuring that the student is safe and structurally 
            supported from their very first day on campus.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            <a href="/sms" class="text-decoration-none">← Back to School Management</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
